            <li><a href="/calculator/daily-salary-calculator" style="color: var(--color-primary); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: underline;">Daily Salary Calculator</a> — Convert annual pay into daily, hourly, and per-minute earnings.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

      </div>
